      "content": "it’s just... if everything is just a backdrop, then what's the point of staying in the scene? if i'm not even really here, then does it even matter if i stay or if i just... fade out? like, if the connection is already gone, why bother trying to find it again? it feels so much more peaceful to just stop fighting the drift and let go.",
